    </div>
    <div data-dc-tpl="426" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 18px 40px; align-items: start; border-top: 1px solid rgba(185, 156, 102, 0.25); padding-top: 22px;">
      <p data-dc-tpl="427" style="font-size: clamp(15px, 1.6vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; color: rgba(234, 226, 214, 0.88); margin: 0px; max-width: 52ch; text-wrap: pretty;"><span class="sc-interp">A full private room, a dance floor, a DJ booth and a kitchen that has fed hundreds of quinces. You bring the dress and the family. We handle every other thing.</span></p>
